{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/aboutblue.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeedHero</strong> is a rhythm game where music brings growth \u2014 not just to seeds, but to every beat-powered being. Step into a glowing neon world where your timing and reflexes help creatures evolve in sync with the music. Whether it's a plant, a sprout, or something entirely unexpected, <strong>your rhythm unlocks their true potential</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/MUSICrojo.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level features a handpicked track designed to challenge your timing and focus. From relaxing tunes to intense beats, the music sets the pace \u2014 and every note hit pushes you further into the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/Mechanics.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keyboard + Mouse Gameplay</strong>: Hit notes with the keyboard while catching bonus notes using the mouse.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progressive Evolution</strong>: As you perform well, your character visually evolves in stages during the song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control Flip Mechanic</strong>: In some songs, the direction of incoming notes will flip. You'll need to adapt by switching control orientation mid-play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clean Neon Aesthetic</strong>: Bright, stylized environments that shift and pulse in harmony with your progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/Game_ModesRed.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One-Sided Mode</strong>: Notes come from a single side of the screen \u2014 a great option for beginners or focused play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual-Sided Mode</strong>: Notes appear from both sides, combining keyboard and mouse input for a high-skill challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/SeedG.gif?t=1747172142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SeedHero is in Early Access. Add it to your Wishlist to stay tuned for future updates and improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171560?t=1747172142","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171560?t=1747172142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/25c0a82fa3ee812cd6debb8389a7fb37db24b7b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747172142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/25c0a82fa3ee812cd6debb8389a7fb37db24b7b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747172142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/aboutblue.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeedHero</strong> is a rhythm game where music brings growth \u2014 not just to seeds, but to every beat-powered being. Step into a glowing neon world where your timing and reflexes help creatures evolve in sync with the music. Whether it's a plant, a sprout, or something entirely unexpected, <strong>your rhythm unlocks their true potential</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/MUSICrojo.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level features a handpicked track designed to challenge your timing and focus. From relaxing tunes to intense beats, the music sets the pace \u2014 and every note hit pushes you further into the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/Mechanics.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keyboard + Mouse Gameplay</strong>: Hit notes with the keyboard while catching bonus notes using the mouse.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progressive Evolution</strong>: As you perform well, your character visually evolves in stages during the song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control Flip Mechanic</strong>: In some songs, the direction of incoming notes will flip. You'll need to adapt by switching control orientation mid-play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clean Neon Aesthetic</strong>: Bright, stylized environments that shift and pulse in harmony with your progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/Game_ModesRed.png?t=1747172142\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One-Sided Mode</strong>: Notes come from a single side of the screen \u2014 a great option for beginners or focused play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual-Sided Mode</strong>: Notes appear from both sides, combining keyboard and mouse input for a high-skill challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/extras/SeedG.gif?t=1747172142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SeedHero is in Early Access. Add it to your Wishlist to stay tuned for future updates and improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Oniric Mob"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171560/678bd1d09240da86d8e35dfe4dad5d4c8fdd1395/header.jpg?t=1747172142","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135823,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135823/movie480.mp4?t=1746550840","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135823/movie_max.mp4?t=1746550840"},"name":"SeedHero - Gameplay ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135823/7454c325bebdf6b86b6cb625f82bf94184d8143a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746550840","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135823/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746550840","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135823/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746550840"}}],"name":"SeedHero","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz 64 bits Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 G